     :       AggregateExec: mode=Single, gby=[], aggr=[topk_as_agg(DISTINCT col_1, p_0.ctid_0, 2, [1]) ORDER BY [col_1 DESC NULLS FIRST] as __topk, count(1) FILTER (WHERE r_1.score > Int64(80)) as window_agg_1]
     :         VisibilityFilterExec: tables=[p, r], pruned=[r]
     :           ProjectionExec: expr=[id@0 as col_1, ctid_0@1 as ctid_0, score@2 as score, ctid_1@3 as ctid_1]
     :             HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, on=[(id@1, product_id@0)], projection=[id@1, ctid_0@0, score@3, ctid_1@4]
     :               CooperativeExec
     :                 PgSearchScan: table=p, segments=1, query={"with_index":{"query":{"match":{"field":"description","value":"laptop","tokenizer":null,"distance":null,"transposition_cost_one":null,"prefix":null,"conjunction_mode":false}}}}
     :               CooperativeExec
     :                 PgSearchScan: table=r, segments=1, dynamic_filters=1, query="all"
